# Cloudflare Pages redirects (ignored by other hosts).
# The app uses hash routing (`/#/invite/<CODE>`), but the Edge Functions build invite links as
# <APP_PUBLIC_URL>/invite/<CODE> (supabase/functions/{admin,invites}/index.ts). Send those to the
# hash route; without this rule the path is lost and the visitor lands on the home screen.
/invite/* /#/invite/:splat 302
